        "kind": "native_bundle",
        "license_id": "See bundled upstream LICENSE and NOTICE files",
        "material_path": "inputs/input-1",
        "purpose": "Exact original baseline STP pin with five direct BV/array checks and an actual source-built upstream KLEE kleaver consumer: four core STP/MiniSat queries, exact validity results, overflow and array counterexample models, statistics, and both core log formats. Full KLEE VM/POSIX runtime is not qualified. LLVM runtime is an official artifact import. Baseline stp identity is preserved; this support profile is not a new resource family.",
